{
  "name": "nemt-start-execution",
  "description": "启动策略的实盘或模拟盘执行。\n\n**参数说明**:\n- strategy_id: 策略ID，必填\n- mode: 执行模式，必填（paper_trading | live）\n- symbol: 交易品种，必填\n- capital: 分配资金，默认使用策略预设\n\n**权限要求**: 需要 'execute' 权限级别，且需确认风险提示\n\n**示例**: 启动模拟盘执行",
  "arguments": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "strategy_id": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "要执行的策略ID"
      },
      "mode": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": ["paper_trading", "live"],
        "description": "执行模式：paper_trading=模拟盘，live=实盘"
      },
      "symbol": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "交易品种"
      },
      "capital": {
        "type": "number",
        "minimum": 100,
        "description": "分配资金金额"
      }
    },
    "required": ["strategy_id", "mode", "symbol"],
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#"
  },
  "permissions": {
    "level": "execute",
    "description": "启动执行需要 execute 权限，实盘还需额外确认"
  }
}
